Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "AnimalCrossingRainyWeather" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:actor1 a :Actor ;
    :description "German Shepherd running across the road" .

:weather1 a :RainyCondition .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Collision risk with animal crossing into traffic lane" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.90"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Collision risk with animal crossing into traffic lane under low visibility, rainy conditions.
Severity Score: 0.90